abstract: >
  Boundary-Complete Relational Dynamics (BCRD) is a research programme studying
  relational quantum dynamics, recoupling, and candidate quantum-geometric
  constructions. This public repository contains curated publication snapshots,
  reproducibility artifacts, release metadata, and frozen provenance. The
  September 2026 four-simplex paper is explicitly scoped to a Riemannian,
  leading-large-spin, single-vertex result and does not by itself derive a
  continuum limit or four-dimensional general relativity.
